    "own_line": true,
    "norm": "Tests that a {@link PaxDate} can be converted to the equivalent ISO {@link LocalDate} via {@link LocalDate#from(java.time.temporal.TemporalAccessor)}. <p> Each test case pairs a Pax date with the ISO date it should map to. The Pax calendar is anchored such that {@code 0001-01-01 (Pax)} equals {@code 0000-12-31 (ISO)}, so the two representations rarely share the same day, month or year numbers."
   },
   {
    "id": "i2",
