    "own_line": true,
    "norm": "Supplies {@code (paxDate, expectedIsoDate)} pairs covering a range of calendar features: the epoch boundary, leap years (with the inserted one-week 'Pax' month), century/quad-century rules, and dates in the 'Before Current Era' (negative proleptic years)."
